         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Introduction\n\nWe have seen counting systems based on our fingers. But we also have toes, and they can help create another numerical system.\n\nIndigenous peoples in Mesoamerica may have taken inspiration from their toes to build theirs.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "eff64c64-93e1-411e-9fc1-bf146a9ab1d7",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "eff64c64-93e1-411e-9fc1-bf146a9ab1d7",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "590d1c30-1e72-4975-bc00-2011905b3dba",
               "text": "Original Text",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=590d1c30-1e72-4975-bc00-2011905b3dba",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Previous Numbers\n\nIn the last class, we counted up to 10 with Mesoamerican numbers. We observed:\n\n- Zero is an independent symbol.\n- Numbers 1 to 4 use circles on one line.\n- Five is a bar on the first line.\n- Numbers 6 to 10 keep the bar and add a second line with circles.",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "971672db-38fc-4f44-be97-06fe95e04552",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "971672db-38fc-4f44-be97-06fe95e04552",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Next Five Numbers\n\nNow we want to represent the numbers from 11 to 15.\n\nShould we also add another line to represent them?",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "144043e5-8766-484d-9e5f-ae4f1720a19c",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "144043e5-8766-484d-9e5f-ae4f1720a19c",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "inlove",
